193
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:24,000
It's a big problem for ever curating that lending pool.

194
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:28,000
It's a big problem for assets that are in a vault with those assets.

195
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:30,000
It's a problem for everything else around.

196
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:33,000
I want to touch on those points specifically, but I did want to replay.

197
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:36,000
That's our core exploration here.

